{"3387100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "15 Minutes", "steam_appid": 3387100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Subterranean Anomaly Horror Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep beneath the earth in an  underground complex, you awaken to the echoing <i>beep</i> of a countdown. <strong>Explosives have been armed</strong>. The lights flicker. The walls breathe. You don’t know how you got here—but you do know one thing: when the music stops, so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a looping, ever-changing labyrinth where nothing stays the same for long. Shadows twist wrong. Objects duplicate. Faces lie. You're being watched, but you’re not sure by what—or <i>how many</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.poster.avif?t=1761235143\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.webm?t=1761235143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.mp4?t=1761235143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor may conceal an anomaly: some subtle, some grotesque. Identify them. Memorize patterns. Trust your instincts, not your eyes. The music is your timer, and once it ends... so does your chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot what shouldn't be there before it's too late?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7